cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or reference this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Context Handoff: a browser extension for compact, structured AI chat handoffs"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Context Handoff contributors"
repository-code: "https://github.com/__OWNER__/context-handoff"
url: "https://__OWNER__.github.io/context-handoff/"
abstract: >-
  Context Handoff is an open-source Chrome Manifest V3 extension that converts a
  long claude.ai conversation into a compact handoff (task goal, latest file
  versions, recent turns, next step) as an XML resume prompt or a Markdown file,
  so work can continue in a fresh chat or another AI assistant. All processing is local.
keywords:
  - chrome-extension
  - manifest-v3
  - claude
  - context-window
  - prompt-engineering
  - markdown-export
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-25"
